WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 6 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:10.470
Please, no matter what Cassie says, I am still a princess of this empire.

2
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:14.670
My best mates are wounded. They need food.

3
00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.580
A princess has one foot in the grave and she's still trying to keep her boy foits fed.

4
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.340
Some of the favorite princesses drank too much tonight.

5
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.460
They threw up plenty of good stuff in that barrel.

6
00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:40.620
If you're really that hungry,

7
00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.180
go ahead and treat yourselves.

8
00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:51.480
Keep the gourmet puke for yourself.

9
00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.080
Since you love playing lapdog so much,

10
00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.920
eating your master's vomit must feel like a reward.

11
00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:11.600
Calling Princess Cassie every every word you said today!

12
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:13.800
You're dead meat!

13
00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:25.080
She's been gone forever. What did she run off?

14
00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:27.280
Run off where?

15
00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:28.880
Honestly,

16
00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:32.120
expecting handouts from some old woman who can't even feed herself?

17
00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.880
You two are pathetic.

18
00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:38.450
She wouldn't abandon us.

19
00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:41.140
I trust her.

20
00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:47.480
And if things get really bad, I can just shift into my rabbit form.

21
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.480
You guys can eat my meat to stay alive.

22
00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:51.480
Shut up!

23
00:01:51.480 --> 00:02:01.200
By the way, we never actually introduced ourselves.

24
00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.200
I'm Finn from the Lop Rabbit Clan.

25
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.200
Most of my family is gone.

26
00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.760
That's why the army drafted me.

27
00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:10.280
What about you?

28
00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:13.280
You already know my name kid. Do I really need to say it again?

29
00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:17.450
I'm an assassin from the Black Wolf Clan.

30
00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:21.450
Those royal cowards set me up and badly wounded me.

31
00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:23.450
Like hell they would have caught me otherwise.

32
00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:32.650
Just a drifter.

33
00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:33.650
A drifter?

34
00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:35.650
You're a dragon. There's no way you're some nobody.

35
00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:37.650
What do you think we're stupid?
